  "display_name": "SidneyBissoli/uis-mcp-server",
  "description": "UNESCO Institute for Statistics (UIS) with full provenance on every response: search ~5,000 indicators on education (enrolment, completion, literacy, out-of-school, expenditure), science and R&D (SDG 9.5), culture (SDG 11.4) and communication, and retrieve them by country, region and year — with source URL, data release, retrieval timestamp, licence and UIS citation. Everyday and US wording (enrollment, spending, preschool, university) is resolved to the UIS's own terms. Remote (Streamable HTTP, no auth) or local stdio.",
